{"id":"1bd3906a14e9f667","group":"58","path":"58/batch19/58-df-omitted.md","title":"Omitted Type","display":"df-omitted — Omitted Type","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-omitted","aliases":["58-df-omitted","Omitted Type"],"display":"df-omitted — Omitted Type","depends_on":["[[58-df-type]]","[[58-df-satisfaction]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-omitted"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-omitted</span><span>Omitted Type</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-omitted — Omitted Type"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"c8dfa3853919882a\" href=\"?note=c8dfa3853919882a\" title=\"58-df-type\">58-df-type</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"8b6a90316aad78a4\" href=\"?note=8b6a90316aad78a4\" title=\"58-df-satisfaction\">58-df-satisfaction</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>Explicit relation signatures used below: <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CompleteType}_S\\subseteq V^{5}\">\\(\\mathrm{CompleteType}_S\\subseteq V^{5}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Model}\\subseteq V^{2}\">\\(\\operatorname{Model}\\subseteq V^{2}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{OmittableType}_S\\subseteq V^{4}\">\\(\\mathrm{OmittableType}_S\\subseteq V^{4}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{OmittedType}_S\\subseteq V^{3}\">\\(\\mathrm{OmittedType}_S\\subseteq V^{3}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RealizesType}_S\\subseteq V^{3}\">\\(\\mathrm{RealizesType}_S\\subseteq V^{3}\\)</span>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma,T,p,\\mathcal M,n\\in V\">\\(\\Sigma,T,p,\\mathcal M,n\\in V\\)</span> (signature, theory, type, structure and tuple arity)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CompleteType}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{CompleteType}_S\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RealizesType}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{RealizesType}_S\\)</span> (type predicates, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"c8dfa3853919882a\" href=\"?note=c8dfa3853919882a\" title=\"58-df-type\">58-df-type</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Model}\">\\(\\mathrm{Model}\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Univ}\">\\(\\mathrm{Univ}\\)</span> (model predicate and universe operator, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"8b6a90316aad78a4\" href=\"?note=8b6a90316aad78a4\" title=\"58-df-satisfaction\">58-df-satisfaction</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{OmittedType}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{OmittedType}_S\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{OmittableType}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{OmittableType}_S\\)</span> (predicates defined here)</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}omitted\\text{-}in\\text{-}model}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{OmittedType}_S(p,\\mathcal M,n)\\leftrightarrow\nn\\in\\omega\\land\\neg\\exists\\bar a\\in\\mathrm{Univ}(\\mathcal M)^n\\;\\mathrm{RealizesType}_S(\\mathcal M,\\bar a,p)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}omitted\\text{-}in\\text{-}model}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{OmittedType}_S(p,\\mathcal M,n)\\leftrightarrow\nn\\in\\omega\\land\\neg\\exists\\bar a\\in\\mathrm{Univ}(\\mathcal M)^n\\;\\mathrm{RealizesType}_S(\\mathcal M,\\bar a,p)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}omittable\\text{-}type}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{OmittableType}_S(p,T,\\Sigma,n)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{CompleteType}_S(p,\\varnothing,T,\\Sigma,n)\\land\n\\exists\\mathcal M\\in V\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{Model}(\\mathcal M,T)\\land\\mathrm{OmittedType}_S(p,\\mathcal M,n)\\bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}omittable\\text{-}type}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{OmittableType}_S(p,T,\\Sigma,n)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{CompleteType}_S(p,\\varnothing,T,\\Sigma,n)\\land\n\\exists\\mathcal M\\in V\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{Model}(\\mathcal M,T)\\land\\mathrm{OmittedType}_S(p,\\mathcal M,n)\\bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>An omitted type is not realized in a specified model; an omittable type has some model of the theory that omits it.</li>\n<li>The countable omitting-types theorem is an existence theorem and is not part of either definition.</li>\n<li>Every isolated complete type is realized in every model of the theory, whereas a nonisolated type over a countable theory can be omitted in some countable model.</li>\n<li>Saturation points in the opposite direction: a sufficiently saturated model realizes the relevant types rather than omitting them.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Reference\">[Reference]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Marker, Model Theory: An Introduction</li>\n<li>Sacks, Saturated Model Theory</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Reference","text":"[Reference]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-type","status":"resolved","id":"c8dfa3853919882a","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-type]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-satisfaction","status":"resolved","id":"8b6a90316aad78a4","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-satisfaction]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-type","status":"resolved","id":"c8dfa3853919882a","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{CompleteType}_S$ and $\\mathrm{RealizesType}_S$ (type predicates, see [[58-df-type]])","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-satisfaction","status":"resolved","id":"8b6a90316aad78a4","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Model}$ and $\\mathrm{Univ}$ (model predicate and universe operator, see [[58-df-satisfaction]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{CompleteType}_S\\subseteq V^{5}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Model}\\subseteq V^{2}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{OmittableType}_S\\subseteq V^{4}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{OmittedType}_S\\subseteq V^{3}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{RealizesType}_S\\subseteq V^{3}","display":false},{"tex":"\\Sigma,T,p,\\mathcal M,n\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{CompleteType}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{RealizesType}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Model}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Univ}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{OmittedType}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{OmittableType}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}omitted\\text{-}in\\text{-}model}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{OmittedType}_S(p,\\mathcal M,n)\\leftrightarrow\nn\\in\\omega\\land\\neg\\exists\\bar a\\in\\mathrm{Univ}(\\mathcal M)^n\\;\\mathrm{RealizesType}_S(\\mathcal M,\\bar a,p)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}omittable\\text{-}type}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{OmittableType}_S(p,T,\\Sigma,n)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{CompleteType}_S(p,\\varnothing,T,\\Sigma,n)\\land\n\\exists\\mathcal M\\in V\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{Model}(\\mathcal M,T)\\land\\mathrm{OmittedType}_S(p,\\mathcal M,n)\\bigr)","display":true}],"bytes":2028,"backlinks":[{"id":"f5ad37ae47035116","anchor":"ref-13","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Model}\\subseteq V^2$, $\\mathrm{Univ}:V\\to V$, and $\\mathrm{OmittedType}_S\\subseteq V^3$ are from [[../batch18/58-df-satisfaction.md]] and [[../batch19/58-df-omitted.md]]."},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-902","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch19/58-df-omitted.md|58-df-omitted]]（batch19）"}],"outgoing":["c8dfa3853919882a","8b6a90316aad78a4"]}